## Model card

- **Name:** Gemini 3.8 Flash Cyber
- **Short description:** Gemini 3.8 Flash Cyber is described in local metadata as Google DeepMind’s security-focused fine-tune of Gemini 3.8 Flash for vulnerability detection and patching workflows, with restricted Fairwind/Google-only access and no public pricing. Publicly accessible sources in this pass verified the base Gemini 3.8 Flash family specs but not an independently attributable public spec/benchmark record for this exact “Cyber” variant.
- **Provider / access:** Restricted Fairwind Program / Google-only access (per local metadata). Local metadata lists `google/gemini-3-8-flash-cyber`, `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Not independently verified for this exact cyber variant from accessible public sources in this pass. Base Gemini 3.8 Flash docs are public.
- **IDs:** `gemini-3.8-flash-cyber`, `google/gemini-3-8-flash-cyber`.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens input / 65,536 output tokens per local metadata and consistent with public Gemini 3.8 Flash base-model docs; not independently verified as a distinct published cyber variant spec in this pass.
- **Modalities:** Local metadata states text and code in/out. Public Gemini 3.8 Flash base docs list text/image/video/audio/PDF inputs and text output with capabilities including function calling, search/maps grounding, code execution, structured outputs, computer use, etc.; exact modality/capability set for the restricted cyber fine-tune not independently verified.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-14):** Restricted Fairwind Program; no public pricing found (consistent with local metadata).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary security fine-tune of Gemini 3.8 Flash (per local metadata). Architecture/parameter details not publicly disclosed.

